sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant UI as Tkinter dashboard
    participant Auth as Authentication
    participant RBAC as RBAC manager
    participant MLS as MLS manager
    participant Infer as Inference controller
    participant Flow as Flow controller
    participant DB as Database
    participant Audit as AUDIT_LOG

    User->>UI: Sign in
    UI->>Auth: authenticate
    Auth->>DB: read user, hash, salt, state
    Auth->>Audit: LOGIN_SUCCESS or LOGIN_FAILED
    Auth-->>UI: role, clearance, linked record

    User->>UI: Request protected data
    UI->>RBAC: permission check
    RBAC-->>UI: allow or deny
    UI->>MLS: clearance check
    MLS-->>UI: NRU or NWD decision
    UI->>Infer: validate aggregate shape
    Infer-->>UI: size and tracker decision
    UI->>Flow: action and direction check
    Flow-->>UI: allowed or blocked
    UI->>DB: parameterised read
    DB-->>UI: authorised rows
    UI->>Audit: access outcome
    UI-->>User: projection or denial reason
